<title>INDIA: India approves Hutchison Max Telecom's venture.</title>
<headline>India approves Hutchison Max Telecom's venture.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1996-12-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>India's Industry Ministry on Monday approved a proposal of Hutchison Max Telecom Ltd to invest 5.25 billion rupees to provide mobile telecommunication and voice mail services in the states of Maharashtra and Punjab.</p>
<p>Hutchison Max is a joint venture between India's Max group and Hongkong's Hutchison group.</p>
